      <title>Trump’s SNAP Cuts Are Costing Millions of Children Food Stamps</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/us/politics/snap-cuts-children-trump.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/us/politics/snap-cuts-children-trump.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:02:18 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/23/multimedia/00DC-SNAP-CUTS-wthl/00DC-SNAP-CUTS-wthl-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
      <media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/23/multimedia/00DC-SNAP-CUTS-wthl/00DC-SNAP-CUTS-wthl-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" medium="image" />
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/23/multimedia/00DC-SNAP-CUTS-wthl/00DC-SNAP-CUTS-wthl-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="Trump’s SNAP Cuts Are Costing Millions of Children Food Stamps" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Republicans said the cuts, part of their domestic policy bill, would root out fraud and push adults to work. But two million children have lost benefits.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
